# onnxruntime-genai-android is NOT on Maven Central; the 20 MB AAR is extracted from
# the pinned Microsoft NuGet package and published to mavenLocal during setup.
# Keep both the AAR and the downloaded package out of git (only their .sha256 files are tracked).
